Section 4 – Sui Generis Database Rights.

第四条 数据库专有权利

Where the Licensed Rights include Sui Generis Database Rights that apply to Your use of the Licensed Material:

当许可的权利（Licensed Rights）包括适用于您对授权作品（Licensed Material）的使用的数据库专有权利（Sui Generis Database Rights）时：

a. for the avoidance of doubt, Section 2(a)(1) grants You the right to extract, reuse, reproduce, and Share all or a substantial portion of the contents of the database for NonCommercial purposes only;

a. 为免疑义，第二条(a)款(1)项授予您权利，以摘录、再利用、复制和分享数据库内容的全部或实质部分，但仅限于非商业性目的；

b. if You include all or a substantial portion of the database contents in a database in which You have Sui Generis Database Rights, then the database in which You have Sui Generis Database Rights (but not its individual contents) is Adapted Material, including for purposes of Section 3(b); and

b. 如果您将数据库内容的全部或实质部分纳入您享有数据库专有权利（Sui Generis Database Rights）的数据库中，则您享有数据库专有权利（Sui Generis Database Rights）的数据库（但非其单独内容）是演绎作品（Adapted Material），包括为第三条(b)款之目的；以及

c. You must comply with the conditions in Section 3(a) if You Share all or a substantial portion of the contents of the database.

c. 如果您分享数据库内容的全部或实质部分，您必须遵守第三条(a)款规定的条件。

For the avoidance of doubt, this Section 4 supplements and does not replace Your obligations under this Public License where the Licensed Rights include other Copyright and Similar Rights.

为免疑义，当许可的权利（Licensed Rights）包括其他著作权与类似权利时，本条第四条是对这些权利的补充，而非替代。

