b. 依据本公共许可协议所授予您的权利，在根据前述(a)款终止后：

    1. automatically as of the date the violation is cured, provided it is cured within 30 days of Your discovery of the violation; or

    1. 在您终止违反行为后30日内（自您发现违反行为之日起算），如果已经纠正，则自动恢复；或

    2. upon express reinstatement by the Licensor.

    2. 在许可人明确恢复的情况下。

For the avoidance of doubt, this Section 6(b) does not affect any right the Licensor may have to seek remedies for Your violations of this Public License.

为免疑义，本条(b)款不影响许可人就您违反本公共许可协议的行为寻求补偿或救济的权利。

c. For the avoidance of doubt, the Licensor may also offer the Licensed Material under separate terms or conditions or stop distributing the Licensed Material at any time; however, doing so will not terminate this Public License.

c. 为免疑义，许可人也可随时提供授权作品（Licensed Material）或改变授权条款，但这样做不会撤销本公共许可协议或依据本协议已经授予您的任何权利。

d. Sections 1, 5, 6, 7, and 8 survive termination of this Public License.

d. 第一条、第五条、第六条、第七条和第八条在本公共许可协议终止后继续有效。

